+                    *      *------- o --------*     *       +---+
+                     *    *                   *     *
+                      ****                    *     *
+                                              *     *
+                                 +---+        *     *       +---+
+                                 | E +--------*     *-------+ D |
+                                 +---+         *   *        +---+
+                                                ***
+
+         Figure 2.  Topology Used in Protocol Exchange Diagrams
 ]]></artwork>
-</t>
