+          <t indent="0" pn="section-3.1.7-1">When an intermediate ST agent receives an ACCEPT, it first
+verifies that the message is a response to an earlier CONNECT.
+If not, it responds to the next-hop ST agent with an ERROR-IN-REPLY (LnkRefUnknown) message.  Otherwise, it responds to the
+next-hop ST agent with an ACK, and propagates
